// Heading shape for a workflow step skill. The `md-workflow-skill` hook in
// ../.pre-commit-config.yaml owns which documents this applies to.
//
// These files are the prose an agent reads when it runs a step, not SKILL.md
// files, so `cog skill-lint` does not apply to them. The shape is deliberately
// minimal: one H1 naming the step and nothing else. A step skill that needs
// sections is a step doing too much.
//
// This is an overlay: every other rule still comes from ../.markdownlint-cli2.jsonc,
// which the tool discovers for the working directory and merges over this file. That
// merge is why the project config must never mention MD043 at any value.
{
  "config": {
    "MD043": {
      "headings": [
        // The H1 varies per step: `# Workflow stub: <step>`.
        "*"
      ]
    }
  }
}
